</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He says He will be with me;</l><l>He says He will be with me;</l><l>He goes before me,</l><l>And is beside me,</l><l>So I’m not afraid.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>His arms are underneath me;</l><l>His arms are underneath me;</l><l>His hand upholds me,</l><l>His love enfolds me,</l><l>So I’m not afraid.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>His Word will stand for ever;</l><l>His Word will stand for ever;</l><l>His truth it shall be</l><l>My shield and buckler,</l><l>So I’m not afraid.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He will give grace and glory;</l><l>He will give grace and glory;</l><l>His cross before me,</l><l>His banner o’er me,</l><l>So I’m not afraid.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>So we go singing onward;</l><l>So we go singing onward;</l><l>We’re pressing forward,</l><l>We’re marching upward,</l><l>To Him unafraid.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
